WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.000
THE PHANTOM COLONY

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.000
(Part 1)

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.590
Captain!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.280
Pardon.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.490
It's all right.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.380
That's the maintenance progress report.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:06.580
You could have just
left it on the bridge.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:11.580
I thought this would be quicker.
Anyhow, we're short of food and materials.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.080
We need to find a
supply base, soon.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.540
Y-You're right.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.840
You've gotta be kidding!
What are you doing?!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.840
Look at the monitor
and you'll see!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.620
The La Vie en Rose
is in danger right now!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.880
What's...?

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.680
That's a huge asteroid field.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.200
Are they dummies?

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.190
No, sir. I was going to avoid them
but before I knew it, we were inside.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.050
Captain, you're late!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.780
Yes. Sorry.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:39.380
Can the La Vie en Rose
find anything?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.210
I'll try and see.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:42.780
What the hell?!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:45.980
I can't rescue Leina
if we're stuck in this!

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.330
- Iino!
- Hm?

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.780
Try analyzing the asteroid in
the middle of the monitor.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.150
Right!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.180
This is a dummy.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.380
But not a balloon.
This thing's got a lot of mass.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.960
- Video, maximum zoom.
- Aye!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:04.230
- A warship?
- No.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.280
Captain, this area...

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:12.330
This is the sector where they
built the first Sweetwater-type colony.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.530
It's been ignored for years.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:16.330
Since the colonies
were first developed?

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.030
Right. The word is it's just
a useless shoal zone.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.730
Well, if we're trying
to shake off the Endra...

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.230
Do you hear me, outsiders?

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.190
What's...? Torres!

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:29.120
- We are the Light Tribe of Moon Moon.
- I'm not sure! It's on every channel!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.220
- We are the Light Tribe of Moon Moon.
- Axis, Titans, AEUG, even civilian.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:33.230
- Can you hear me, white warship?
- Axis, Titans, AEUG, even civilian.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.540
That mass of junk is broadcasting it?

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.830
We are the Light Tribe,
who live in Moon Moon.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.460
We have been
awaiting your arrival.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:47.400
You must come to our colony.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.630
- Light Tribe?
- If we join forces,

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.380
we can lead you all
to a better way.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:56.580
You think they're talking about
the Endra, Mr. Bright?

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.830
Do you know what it is, Emary?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.380
The La Vie en Rose
has a file on it.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.860
It's a colony that maintains
total independence.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.670
Can they resupply us?

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:07.730
Yes!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.020
We have to go.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.310
Captain!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.240
Follow their instructions!
Torres!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.020
A-Aye, sir!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.730
Light Tribe! Argama acknowledges!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:20.150
There are two vessels,
are there not?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.230
The white ship alone
may enter Moon Moon.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.550
This is an order.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.940
Caesar, it'll be tight. Be careful.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.960
Hey, you! What do
you think you're doing?!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.330
They call themselves the
"Light Tribe," right?

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.280
Who knows what they're like!

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.730
So?

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.080
You plan to start fighting
inside the colony?!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.170
We did at Shangri-La!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:08.550
This colony isn't nearly as big!
You too, Elle! Stop!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.590
We're not going to start a war!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.520
Wh-What is this?!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.030
Captain Bright!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:38.430
That's hardly space-age fashion!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.430
Did we go back in time?!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.580
W-Wait!

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.680
Look! Giants, just as
Lady Sarasa said there'd be!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.430
Destroy the giants!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:52.210
If they move into Moon Moon,
we'll be in danger!

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.490
Are they working for the Endra?!

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.230
- Don't move!
- Ow!

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.400
What a giant!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.110
This one's especially
dangerous!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.880
We should use
bombs to destroy it!

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.330
What? But if you did that, 
you'd destroy the port, too!

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.530
- Don't move!
- Calm down!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.330
This mobile suit
isn't what you think--

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:18.140
Ye who have come to Moon Moon. You must
submit to the prophecy of the Light Tribe!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.480
Otherwise...

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.510
You guys don't keep up
with current events, do you?

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:24.730
Judau!
Let's take it apart!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.030
Elle!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.500
Better we take it apart
than strangers do, right?

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:32.130
Take it apart?

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:36.180
Sure thing.
We'll take it apart.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.530
I see. That's very
understanding of you.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.330
I wonder if they might
catch on to this trick.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:47.360
These youths are taking it well.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:50.630
Yes, sir. They're the ones
Lady Sarasa wishes to see.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.730
What is this? Why is the Double
Zeta being taken apart?

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.530
What are you all doing?

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.960
The giant is being destroyed...!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.080
Astonaige?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:04.630
Why are they taking
the Double Zeta apart?

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.630
Hey!

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:09.360
They wanted the Double
Zeta "destroyed," so...

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.700
Oh...

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.650
That's...
That's a terrible shame.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.440
Captain, what's going on?

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:18.910
Roux.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.730
Oh, no!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.030
Roux?

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:27.230
Miss Emary, the truth is...!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:32.610
Oh! Our god!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.930
Is this enough to convince them?

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.190
I'm coming down!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:51.170
We have overcome our grief
and taken apart one of our giants.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.670
We'd like you to
hear our requests.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.530
I'd like you to speak directly
with our prophet.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.510
I'm sure she will receive you.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.960
We can't just weep forever!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.140
There are things we must do
despite our deep grief!

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.130
- Are there?
- There are.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.960
I guess.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.730
I don't see Judau.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:13.030
- Hurry!
- Not you!

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.060
What's...?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.280
The only electrical devices we use
are the spaceport hatches.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.730
Electrical devices?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:28.250
And only chosen warriors
are permitted to use them.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:30.950
What's...?!

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.740
Moon Moon, our home.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.380
This is a colony?

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.220
Forgive the delay.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:58.560
You outsiders came here to Moon Moon
on your own to offer us your help.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.060
We are grateful.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.730
It's nothing. I was tired of fighting.
I wanted some rest.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:07.990
She means we were attracted by how
the Light Tribe doesn't use machines.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:13.290
You're saying you'll help our
Light Tribe achieve its goals?

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:14.960
Yes.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.040
Then swear an oath to the
Catl outside the temple!

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.590
Then you will be one of us!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:29.650
Light of moon and sun,
shine upon our bodies and hearts!

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.910
- We believe in the peace to come
to this cosmos defiled by war...

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:33.450
- Why are we playing along here?
- We believe in the peace to come
to this cosmos defiled by war...

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:34.050
- Why are we playing along here?
- and offer all our strength
to the moon and to the Catl!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.650
- Because Chara likes this.
- and offer all our strength
to the moon and to the Catl!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.030
- So we have no choice
if we wanna gain her favor.
- and offer all our strength
to the moon and to the Catl!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:43.150
Now then, to prepare you to
assist us in our plan--

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.020
I'm going to take a tour inside the colony.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.950
You should stay on the ship!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:53.450
I'm sure we can come to an agreement,
even if Mistress Chara goes for a walk, Mr. Gottn.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.820
Thank you!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:10:00.380
Mistress Chara... we're just stalling
till Glemy brings the new ship.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.280
I like how green it is here.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:07.050
Beecha! Mondo!
Go with her!

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.550
Hey, pretty lady.
Where you from?

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:11.840
Am I that pretty?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:12.980
Very!

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.690
Doesn't matter
how old a girl is...

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:17.270
Hey, sister!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.350
- Huh?
- Wanna have some tea?

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.650
Where's Chara?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.300
Trouble!

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.450
Judau.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.010
Really?

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.520
Exactly!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.870
I'm so sorry.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.320
I wouldn't have come if you
weren't so pretty, Rasara.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.660
Oh, my.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:37.800
Oh! You get shy when
people compliment you?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.600
Please don't tease me.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.970
That woman!
I've seen her!

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.330
That woman there?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.600
- Yeah.
- The one with the hair...

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.680
I don't have any money.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:52.100
The woman from the ship
docked in the opposite port. Get her!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:57.500
I don't feel like I'm inside a colony.
It speaks to my wild heart!

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.320
- What? Stop! Lemme go!
- Hold still!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.570
Why, you...!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:10.280
- They put her in that horse cart!
- Follow them! I'll tell Gottn!

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:11.460
Right!

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:13.780
You want us to
join the Light Tribe?

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.200
Yes. You will swear
your loyalty to us.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.080
And then we will give
you our full cooperation.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.990
Naturally, that includes resupplying you.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.000
All we want is to
get some supplies!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.440
We'll pay for them!

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.710
Captain!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.330
If you're in such a rush...

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.420
then we have no choice.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:36.830
What do you want our ship for?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:41.810
We need a ship to spread the teachings
of the Light Tribe across the cosmos.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.770
Trouble, sir!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.280
What is it?!

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:48.400
Mistress Chara of the Endra
has been taken by the rebels!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.690
The Endra?!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:53.910
Don't you think it was rash to
invite our enemies into the colony?!

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:58.400
If we knew which ship
carried our messiah,

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:02.040
we wouldn't have
resorted to this.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.630
So, the prophet in that temple
is waiting for a messiah?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:22.140
Yes. She wishes to spread the
teachings of light across the cosmos.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:25.430
That's why they need my
Endra and the Argama?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:30.440
Yes. I'd think one so beautiful
would easily understand me.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.820
Beautiful? Me?

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.570
- You know how to make a girl happy!
- The Light Tribe wants to...

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:40.410
spread Moon Moon's
back-to-nature teachings, doesn't it?

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.330
Wouldn't that be all right?

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.910
But people can never stop
fighting in the outside world.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.680
If the Light Tribe
ventures into space,

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:52.080
we'd even lose Moon Moon's
peaceful way of life here.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.800
The prophets don't
understand this.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.010
So, that's what these
cheats are planning?!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.720
They've taken
Mistress Chara hostage...

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.890
so they can sell the
Endra to the Argama?!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:05.310
So, now you'll make us
regular soldiers, right?

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:07.930
I know!
We can use that little girl!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.460
It's a good thing
Glemy's not here!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.940
Tie that Leina girl to a Gaza-D!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.110
Tie Leina to a...!
You can't!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:18.330
If you can't, give up any
hope of being a soldier!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.860
Send out the Gaza team!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.620
Tie Leina to one,

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:26.080
and knock out the spear carriers
around the Endra with gas!

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:29.530
You people...
That's going too far!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.860
Stop it! Somebody, help me!
Big Brother!

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:37.440
How can you do this
to a cute little girl?!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.190
What are they doing?!

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.640
Deploy!

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:44.720
They had a giant here?!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.310
It was hidden?!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.640
I'll tell Mr. Glemy about this!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.530
He's out of town.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.550
The giant's moving!

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:55.790
Leina!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.120
Somebody, help me!

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.740
I'm feeling desperate, too!

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:03.050
I have to make a
name for myself here!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:03.980
I've got it!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.210
Big Brother, save me!

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:09.910
What was...?

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.220
What?

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:17.840
Stop this!

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:20.720
You can't bring a mobile
suit into the colony!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.140
Inside the colony...

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.720
I heard my sister's voice.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.810
Your sister?

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:34.400
Yeah! You kidnapped her!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:38.230
That was Glemy Toto.
I had nothing to do with it.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:41.320
Please, ask your captain
to give Leina back.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.670
Captain?

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:46.320
Look, I know the Endra's
captain is kind of a lunatic.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.760
But someone as pretty
as you could convince him!

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:52.210
Well, certainly I'm pretty
enough, but...

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.710
The objective is
Mistress Chara's rescue!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.720
The people here are armed.
Be careful!

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.560
Stop!
Who's running that thing?!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:05.060
I'll rescue Chara, and then
they'll have to acknowledge me!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.440
Gaza-Cs, threaten the
town from the temple hill!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.020
All personnel, seize the temple!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.830
It's a car! RUN!

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:37.420
That's...!

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.430
Gazas!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.750
It's Leina!
Leina's on that thing!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.720
Did you tell your men to do this!?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:51.140
I'm too pretty to do something
that dirty! It was Gottn!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.220
The giants! Lord Catl!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.490
That's isn't Lord Catl!
They're machines from the outside!

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.520
Catl?

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:59.100
The local god.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.150
Okay, I'll bring
your sister back.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:05.240
I have to prove my beauty
isn't just skin deep.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.940
Seriously?
She's giving Leina back?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.100
You must be tired after
hanging there for so long.

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.520
You noticed me?

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:16.210
I may need your help.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:19.750
She's pretty.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.710
Gottn! Damn you!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.010
Didn't you consider
this colony's size?!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.750
And to what purpose
do you defile this temple?!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:32.640
You're one to talk,
after making a deal with them!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.580
This colony is under our control
until Mistress Chara is returned!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.030
I don't know what
you're talking about!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.900
Don't play dumb!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.170
Stop! You, in the Gaza-C!
Stop!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:48.000
Oh, that idiot!
LOOK OVER HERE!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.350
Who is that?!

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.400
The giant!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.590
Get down!

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:00.130
Mistress Chara?!
What are you doing here?!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.340
Gimme a hand!

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.730
Hey! What about Leina?!

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.010
Mistress Chara! You're all right!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.730
- Get back to the ship!
- Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.060
Gottn! Gottn!

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:16.590
Chara! Give me
my sister, Leina!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:20.940
What? Oh, yeah. Right.
Leave it to me!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.960
A mobile suit!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:27.240
I've got a bad feeling about this.
Go after Chara!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:31.320
This is no time to be scared, guys!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.230
Roux, if you go, you'll just
add to the chaos in there!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:36.410
We haven't heard any
word from the captain!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.470
And Judau's nowhere
to be found, either!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.710
Let's go, Elle! Iino!

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:41.720
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:49.810
Is this going to work?

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.220
Gaza-D, stop!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.840
Gaza-D en route to the temple! Stop!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.360
Mistress Chara!

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.150
Mistress Chara, you're okay?

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.890
Return the girl
tied to the Gaza-D!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.030
Why?

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.250
Why? Well...

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.680
I knew it.
The Endra's attacking.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.760
Why do I have
to save the girl...?

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.510
Oh, you've got some nerve!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:31.080
Whoa!
You wanna fight that bad?!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:32.950
Fine!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:37.560
Is this any place to
fight in mobile suits?!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.920
No! If you attack Chara...!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.740
- I need something to signal them!
- R-Right!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.530
- What's this?
- A smoke ball!

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.890
Why, you...!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.560
Are you an enemy, too?!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:04.920
It's the R-Jarja!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.420
Who brought it?!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.920
Mistress Chara, the R-Jarja
is here for you!

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.680
Oh? You brought it for me?

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.630
Clear out of
Mistress Chara's seat or I'll kill you!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.360
Y-Yes, sir!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.650
Let's go, my R-Jarja!

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.810
Where did you go?

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.490
Where are you hiding,
Double Zeta?!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.620
You guys!
Find the Double Zeta!

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.330
Big Brother!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.720
- Leina!
- It's all yours!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.200
Leina! Hang on!

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.800
We're docking!
Do you read me?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.430
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:13.010
Where's Chara?!
Give me back my little sister!

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:16.410
There he is! Double Zeta,
you've come out!

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.620
Big Brother!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.770
Leina!

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:23.230
That mobile suit...
Chara! Are you in there?!

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.700
What about your promise
to save Leina?!

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:30.100
I won't forgive
anyone around me!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.140
At this rate,
she'll destroy the temple!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.220
Mistress Chara's in a dangerous state!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:42.640
Order all mobile suits to retreat!

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:43.580
Sir!

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.040
Captain Bright!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.320
Can't Judau see they've
taken Leina hostage?!

00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:53.240
Leina!
Lemme go!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:59.010
You just have to
fight me, Double Zeta!

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:01.530
It's your fault
I lost Leina again!

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.840
Chara, eject!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.620
Over this little damage?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:13.210
Eject!
That suit's as good as dead!

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:15.390
Dead? The R-Jarja?

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:29.860
The one piloting that giant...
It's Moon Moon's messiah!

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:32.070
The messiah has come!

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:34.070
Judau's their messiah?

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:38.770
This is the woman who
nearly destroyed our temple.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:42.060
No... it's just that I...

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:45.170
I'm sorry, Judau.
Can you forgive me?

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:47.660
At this point, it doesn't matter.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.540
What a generous heart!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.410
Truly the messiah!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:54.920
Stop that.
I'm not anyone's messiah.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:57.160
I have a name,
and it's Judau.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:01.020
Well then, Judau.
I have a favor to ask.

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:05.330
If you're gonna
ask a guy a favor...

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:06.430
Young man!

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:07.730
Shut up!

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:20.440
What are you doing, Rasara?

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:21.660
Why?

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:25.880
Rasara? I am not her.

00:22:25.880 --> 00:22:29.570
I am Sarasa Moon,
leader of the Light Tribe.

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:31.050
The prophet.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:50.770
So, it looks like we end
up imprisoned at Moon Moon.

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:52.170
Then we run.

00:23:52.170 --> 00:23:54.970
When we do,
Mondo appears with Rasara,

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:59.810
and we work with the traitors
to get the Double Zeta back.

00:23:59.810 --> 00:24:04.670
In the end, Glemy returns and
tries to take Leina back!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:08.770
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Phantom Colony."

00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:10.200
Today's story continues!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
THE PHANTOM COLONY

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
(Part 2)
